sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Usuario
    participant C as Cliente
    participant A as API
    participant OR as OpenRouter
    participant DB as Postgres

    U->>C: Click "Resumir nota"
    C->>A: POST /ai/summarize {note_id}
    A->>A: verificar Pro + rate-limit
    A->>DB: SELECT note WHERE id
    DB-->>A: note (content)
    alt longitud < 800 palabras
        A-->>C: 200 {summary: nota corta}
    else
        A->>OR: chat completion (gpt-4o-mini)
        OR-->>A: texto resumen
        A->>DB: INSERT ai_usage (model, cost)
        A-->>C: 200 {summary}
    end
    C->>U: Muestra resumen + opción "guardar"